    "name": {
      "en": "A Journey to the North Xinjiang",
      "zh": "北疆之旅"
    },
    "date": {
      "en": "Feb, 2024",
      "zh": "2024 年 2 月"
    },
    "ossPrefix": "journey-to-the-north-xinjiang",
    "totalSize": 111466539984,
    "totalAmount": 3065,
    "pickedAmount": 244,
    "banner": "2024.02.05_17.13.26a.jpg",
    "desc": {
      "zh": "<p>2024 年 2 月，我踏上了前往北疆的旅途。这是一片我从来没有触及过的陌生土地，甚至可以算是有些难以想象。寒冬的气息笼罩着每一座山峰，草原经历秋风变得萧瑟广阔。旅途的路线从乌鲁木齐到伊犁，再到阿勒泰，我见到了天山的冰封山谷，在赛里木湖经历了<em>一次难忘的奇遇</em>，也领略了喀纳斯的冰雪仙境。对于一个从来没怎么见过雪的南方人来说，北疆的每一寸土地都在我的意料之外。",
      "en": "<p>Xinjiang. The kind of place that makes \"<em>remote</em>\" look underrated. Even the airplane ride there from Wuhan (approx. center CHN) takes 4 hours. That's an existential crisis in my economy class seat. Coming from where snowflakes are just rumors and parkas outnumber snowy days, I – an honorary Southerner by climate denial – ventured into this landscape. Turns out it's a totally snow paradise in winter.</p>"
    },
